            <ArticleTitle>Myofibrillar abnormalities following cardiac muscle cell injury.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>367-82</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A review is presented of morphological aspects of myofibrillar alterations which occur in cardiac muscle cells following various types of injury. Emphasis is placed on the association between specific patterns of alterations involving the structure or the orientation of myofibrils and diverse forms of myocardial injury.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
